1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
To filter out a nuisance feature, we must detect it. We use Semantic Corruption.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Think about it. In NLP, we shuffle word order.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
If a classifier remains accurate on scrambled text, it is only counting words.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
In CV, we apply random patch masking.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
If a medical model still predicts, it is reading scanner artifacts.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Semantic corruption exposes our shortcuts.
